Package: radarsunburst
Title: Radar Profiles Surrounded by Counted Hierarchies
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Muyao", "Shen", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
    email = "shenmuyao.bio@gmail.com")
Description: Draw composite charts combining group means of numeric metrics,
    an independent metric-label ring, and a sunburst of counted records in a
    hierarchy. Counts and configurable proportions are calculated from input
    rows, including branches that terminate at different depths. Standard
    'ggplot2' layers support themes and static export, with optional interactive
    conversion through 'plotly'.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
